  "translation": "Eliisha no jooɗii e nder ⟨את⟩ galle makko, mawɓe ɓen no jooɗii ⟨את⟩ e makko; o neldi gorko iwde e yeeso makko, hade jibuɗo on arde e makko, o wi'i e mawɓe ɓen: Nji'i-ɗon wonde ɓiy waroowo on neldi ngam ittude ⟨את⟩ hoore am? Ƴeew, so jibuɗo on arii, udditu-ɗon damal ngal, ñaamu-ɗon mo e damal: wonaa daande koyɗe Joomi makko caggal makko?",
